WEBVTT

00:09:59.762 --> 00:10:01.221
Ladies and gentlemen, Al Gore.

00:10:01.221 --> 00:10:04.350
AG: I have one other thing to say,
and I've said this before.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:06.477
Do not give up hope.

00:10:06.518 --> 00:10:08.270
And remember always,

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:12.775
that political will
is itself a renewable resource.

00:10:12.816 --> 00:10:14.068
Thank you.

00:10:14.735 --> 00:10:16.070
WPR: Thank you so much, Al.

00:10:16.111 --> 00:10:21.158
(Applause and cheers)